  section "`section **bold** _ital_`"
    "`task **bold** _ital_`": 4: "`actor **bold** _ital_`"
  section `section **bold** _ital_`
    `task **bold** _ital_`: 3: `actor **bold** _ital_`
  section section a `code` b
    task a `code` b: 2: actor a `code` b
  section section <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
    task <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O: 1: actor <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
  section section one\ntwo
    task one\ntwo: 5: actor one\ntwo
